sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor L as Lecturer
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Analytics as Backend API
  participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)

  L->>UI: Open analytics for a course
  activate UI
  UI->>Analytics: GET /api/analytics/:courseId
  activate Analytics
  Analytics->>DB: Aggregate attempts + question metadata
  activate DB

  par parallel aggregations
    DB-->>Analytics: KPIs (totalSubmissions, uniqueStudents, avgScore, passRate)
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: Score distribution (buckets 0-20..81-100)
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: Topic performance (group by topic, subtopic)
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: Bloom's performance (group by bloomLevel)
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: SOLO performance (group by soloLevel)
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: Cross-matrix (topic x bloomLevel)
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: Per-question option distribution
  and
    DB-->>Analytics: Per-student weak topics
  end

  deactivate DB
  Analytics-->>UI: CourseAnalytics JSON
  deactivate Analytics
  UI-->>L: Render dashboard (KPI cards + Recharts: bar, pie, heatmap + attempts table)
  deactivate UI
